وا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "ذُقْنَ", "plain": "ذُقْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/858c64f355a35cb8f1ce.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "54:39", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4885.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Now taste My punishment after My warnings!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Azabımı ve uyarılarımı tadın!\" (dedik).", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو چکھو میرا عذاب اور ڈر کے فرمان،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka rasakanlah azab-Ku dan ancaman-ancaman-Ku.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَذُوقُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/581217cab00c10f5edcc.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa okusite", "en": "so taste", "tr": "öyleyse tadın", "fr": "goûtez donc", "id": "maka rasakanlah", "ur": "پس چکھو", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা আস্বাদন করো", "fa": "پس بچشید"}}, {"text": "عَذَابِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَنُذُرِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "38:57", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4027.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Here is a boiling and an ice-cold draught, so let them taste it,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İşte artık tatsınlar onu ki, o kaynar su ve irindir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ان کو یہ ہے تو اسے چکھیں کھولتا پانی اور پیپ", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Inilah (azab neraka), biarlah mereka merasakannya, (minuman mereka) air yang sangat panas dan air yang sangat dingin.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلْيَذُوقُوهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2ad6160d9b7eeda3a40e.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa neka ga okuse", "en": "so let them taste it", "tr": "öyleyse tatsınlar", "fr": "qu'ils le goûtent donc", "id": "maka biarlah mereka merasakannya", "ur": "پس وہ اسے چکھیں", "bn": "অতএব তারা তা আস্বাদন করুক", "fa": "پس باید آن را بچشند"}}, {"text": "حَمِيمٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَغَسَّاقٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "59:15", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5141.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "On the likeness of those (who suffered) a short time before them, they taste the ill-effects of their own conduct, and theirs is painful punishment.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Bu yahudilerin durumu) kendilerinden az önce, işlerinin günahını tatmış olan, ahirette de kendileri için acı bir azab bulunan kimselerin (Bedir'de cezalarını bulan putperestlerin) durumu gibidir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ان کی سی کہاوت جو ابھی قریب زمانہ میں ان سے پہلے تھے انہوں نے اپنے کام کا وبال چکھا اور ان کے لیے دردناک عذاب ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Mereka adalah) seperti orang-orang Yahudi yang belum lama sebelum mereka telah merasai akibat buruk dari perbuatan mereka, dan bagi mereka azab yang pedih.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "كَمَثَلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَبْلِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَرِيبًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ذَاقُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/65a45b0e5c5f257c70b0.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they tasted", "bs": "okusili su", "tr": "tattılar", "fr": "ils ont goûté", "id": "mereka telah merasakan", "ur": "انہوں نے چکھا", "bn": "তারা স্বাদ নিল", "fa": "چشیدند"}}, {"text": "وَبَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَمْرِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَلِيمٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "44:49", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4463.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(Saying): Taste! Lo! thou wast forsooth the mighty, the noble!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ona şöyle denir! \"Tat bakalım azabı! hani sen kendine göre çok güçlü ve çok üstündün.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "چکھ، ہاں ہاں تو ہی بڑا عزت والا کرم والا ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Rasakanlah, sesungguhnya kamu orang yang perkasa lagi mulia.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ذُقْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4a97964fcb189b6a4dac.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "taste!", "bs": "okusi!", "tr": "tat!", "fr": "goûte !", "id": "rasakanlah!", "ur": "چکھ!", "bn": "স্বাদ নাও!", "fa": "بچش!"}}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكَرِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "65:9", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5226.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So that it tasted the ill-effects of its conduct, and the consequence of its conduct was loss.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İşlerinin vebalini tattılar. İşlerinin sonucu tam bir hüsran olmuştur.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو انہوں نے اپنے کیے کا وبال چکھا اور ان کے کام انجام گھاٹا ہوا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka merasakan akibat yang buruk dari perbuatannya, dan adalah akibat perbuatan mereka kerugian yang besar.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَذَاقَتْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5606756aa64be4f6437c.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa je okusila", "en": "so it tasted", "tr": "böylece tattı", "fr": "alors elle goûta", "id": "maka ia merasakan", "ur": "پھر اس نے چکھا", "bn": "তখন সে স্বাদ নিল", "fa": "پس چشید"}}, {"text": "وَبَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَمْرِهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَانَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَٰقِبَةُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَمْرِهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خُسْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَذُوقُوا۟", "count": 11, "first": "3:106", "audio": "audio/4ee6d073afac3ee1b660.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa okusite", "en": "so taste", "tr": "öyleyse tadın", "fr": "goûtez donc", "id": "maka rasakanlah", "ur": "پس چکھو", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা আস্বাদন করো", "fa": "پس بچشید"}}, {"arabic": "ذُوقُوا۟", "count": 8, "first": "3:181", "audio": "audio/daf8c4eb9bc638eca660.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "(you all) taste!", "bs": "okusite!", "tr": "tadın!", "fr"